  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="524d1fe6-4d5a-5b8a-8798-5e420728406d" activityNameId="a6e406ed-198d-5c3a-a15b-a166be4e8149" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, biogas combustion, in cogen with ignition gas engine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, biogas combustion, in cogen with ignition gas engine
This dataset needs to be combined with the datasets for the biogas and diesel input, the emissions from the diesel combustion and the infrastrucure expenditures in order to establish the multi-output process which provides the products electricity and heat from cogeneration.;
UUID: 302d3463-713e-3e0e-871a-484daeeb8802
Use of biogas in a cogeneration unit. Included are emissions to air, as well as use and disposal of operational supplements. Excluded are the consumption of biogas and diesel, the emissions due to the combustion of diesel, and infrastructure expenditures.
Location: Conditions of co-generation in Switzerland.
Technology: 50 kWhel lean burn engine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_302d3463-713e-3e0e-871a-484daeeb8802.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
